        "accession_number": "0001671933-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we plan to promote and further develop value-added services, data, and client incentive plans, helping us grow our business.",
        "start_character": 16948,
        "end_character": 17086
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001671933-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001671933-26-000014-e4a2446e7ad648ad",
        "accession_number": "0001671933-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of such efforts, we have developed and plan to continue to enhance OpenPath, our offering intended to give clients access to quality inventory through a simplified, direct connection to publishers.",
        "start_character": 19633,
        "end_character": 19838
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001671933-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001671933-26-000014-e4a2446e7ad648ad",
        "accession_number": "0001671933-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In particular, we believe that the United Kingdom (“U.K.”), Germany, France, China, Japan, India and Australia may represent substantial growth opportunities, and we are investing in developing our business in those and other markets.",
        "start_character": 22277,
        "end_character": 22511
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001671933-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001671933-26-000014-e4a2446e7ad648ad",
        "accession_number": "0001671933-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also believe that by aligning our core offerings with buyers, we are able to avoid the conflicts of interest of our competitors who serve both the buy side and sell side.",
        "start_character": 5406,
        "end_character": 5579
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001671933-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001671933-26-000014-e4a2446e7ad648ad",
        "accession_number": "0001671933-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that participants on the buy side or sell side should be advocates for their buyers or sellers, while those in the marketplace business should act as a referee or have market-driven incentives to protect or enhance the integrity of the marketplace.",
        "start_character": 1328,
        "end_character": 1587
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001671933-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001671933-26-000014-e4a2446e7ad648ad",
        "accession_number": "0001671933-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We expect technology and development expense to increase as we continue to invest in the development of our platform, related offerings and hosting infrastructure to support additional platform features and functionality, increase the",
        "start_character": 26713,
        "end_character": 26947
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001671933-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001671933-26-000014-e4a2446e7ad648ad",
        "accession_number": "0001671933-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We provide and are developing offerings and features that work with publishers and supply-side partners to help ensure access to quality advertising inventory and to maximize decisioning capabilities for buyers of advertising.",
        "start_character": 5580,
        "end_character": 5806
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001671933-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001671933-26-000014-e4a2446e7ad648ad",
        "accession_number": "0001671933-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For example, we are developing new methods of media buying our platform that increasingly leverage data and AI features, meant to make it easier for our clients to utilize data and AI to enhance the effectiveness of their advertising campaigns.",
        "start_character": 18221,
        "end_character": 18465
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001671933-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001671933-26-000014-e4a2446e7ad648ad",
        "accession_number": "0001671933-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Recent technological advancements have driven even greater automation opportunities within new capabilities we are developing, such as Audience Unlimited, which will enable the radical simplification of the data buying process using the agentic co-pilot features available on our platform.",
        "start_character": 7459,
        "end_character": 7748
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001671933-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001671933-26-000014-e4a2446e7ad648ad",
        "accession_number": "0001671933-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Team members are encouraged to come to their managers with questions, feedback or concerns, and we conduct various internal surveys that gauge employee sentiment in areas like career development, culture, manager performance and inclusivity.",
        "start_character": 30727,
        "end_character": 30968
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001671933-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001671933-26-000014-e4a2446e7ad648ad",
        "accession_number": "0001671933-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We empower employees to develop their skills and abilities by acting on great ideas regardless of their role or function, which translates into personal investment in building our organization.",
        "start_character": 31531,
        "end_character": 31724
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001671933-26-000014",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001671933-26-000014-e4a2446e7ad648ad",
        "accession_number": "0001671933-26-000014",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have also launched PubDesk, a dashboard specifically designed for publishers to help them better understand what our clients want by providing detailed information on how buyers view their inventory and what drives bid pricing.",
        "start_character": 19839,
        "end_character": 20069
      }
